OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after woman, 86, dies in
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 80s has died after a
OL,7,Fhouse fire in Lincolnshire, police have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Ffire on Bullen's Lane in Swineshead,
OL,12,Fnear Boston, on Monday at 17:37 BST.
OL,14,FLincolnshire Police said it believed
OL,15,Fthe body was that of an 86-year-old
OL,16,Fwoman who lived at the address,
OL,17,Falthough formal identification had not
OL,18,Fyet taken place.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
