OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after woman, 86, dies in
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force added it had been unable to
OL,7,Flocate any next of kin, and has
OL,8,Fappealed for family members or anyone
OL,9,Fwith information to get in touch.
